2006 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Secure Trade Compliance Platform \050STCP\051 \174 Fidelity Investments\nEnterprise UX \267 Financial Services \267 Research \267 Data Visualization\n\nHelped modernize a legacy trade compliance platform by studying complex user workflows and designing clearer information structures\054 data\055heavy interfaces\054 and visualizations\056 Research and usability testing informed the design decisions\056\n\nSearch \204 PLP Slot Templates \174 Best Buy\nDesign Systems \267 E\055commerce \267 Responsive Layouts\n\nTurned a PLP consistency audit into a stakeholder\055approved\054 reusable slot\055template approach\056 Focused on App and Small View\054 with module\055specific spacing rules\054 designer guidance\054 and development handoff documentation\056 Large View exploration is ongoing\056\n\nWorksite \204 Appointment Detail Experience \174 Best Buy\nEnterprise UX \174 Workflow Design \174 Information Architecture\n\nDesigning stage\055aware appointment details for field agents across multiple service types\054 including delivery\054 installation\054 repair\054 and pickup\056 Work is in progress\056\n\nBU Super League 2026 \174 Fidelity Investments\n0\055to\0551 Product \174 AI\055Assisted Prototyping\n\nDesigned and prototyped an internal sports championship website using Figma Make\073 collaborated with developers through implementation and launch\056)
     /K [ 42 ]
     /P 2007 0 R
     /Pg 1928 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
